WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:07.340
confirm our plan design in Phase 3, and also confirm that the 10-milligram dose is the right dose to take forward.

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:13.520
I think at this point, we're still in discussions with our partner company on the right approach with PTC,

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:18.620
on the right approach with any further engagement with FDA. And I think as soon as we have clarity on that,

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:25.960
we'll, of course, and have those discussions with FDA. We can keep the markets updated, but I think no further

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:28.100
comment until those discussions are complete.

00:00:30.870 --> 00:00:31.550
Next question.

00:00:32.110 --> 00:00:38.250
Thank you. Your next question comes from the line of Graham Parry from Citigroup. Please go ahead.

00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:44.640
Okay, thanks for taking my follow-up. Just on Cozentix, actually, it would be useful if you could qualify the

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:50.880
growth to net adjustments, both in the base year and this year at the quarter. And previously, you talked about

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:59.080
US growing mid-single-digit growth over the mid-term to an 8 billion peak on that asset that was absent from the

00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:01.880
release and side stage. I just wonder if that still stands. Thank you.

00:01:03.280 --> 00:01:03.440
Yes.

00:01:03.480 --> 00:01:08.020
So, on the growth to nets and adjustments for Cozentix from quarter one last year?

00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:19.300
Yeah. So, I think if we exclude the growth to net impact on Cozentix, Cozentix moves into a positive growth territory for the US.

00:01:19.620 --> 00:01:31.460
I think to be exact, around 1%, 0% to 1%, closer to 1% for the quarter. We have to think of, and then I think if we think of an overall basis,

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:33.460
we have two.

00:01:33.520 --> 00:01:43.660
So, if we take a look at our two percentage points in our base for growth to net in the US in Q1 2025, I think we also have a positive impact this year.

00:01:43.900 --> 00:01:46.580
The net comes to about 1% on our overall fee amount.

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:54.900
And I think, you know, Graham, when you look going forward, yeah, we continue to expect to be in this mid-single-digit range globally.

00:01:55.280 --> 00:02:00.300
And I think that will be a mix of US and ex-US.

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:03.040
And we're going to have to, I think, see how the coming quarters evolve.

00:02:03.040 --> 00:02:07.600
But that's our current expectation is that we would be in that mid-single-digit range.

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:27.960
Clearly, the peak sales for Cozentix would most likely be in 2027, given the IRA event in 2028 would impact the overall pricing in Medicare, but also into the Medicaid best price in 2028.

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:33.000
So, all of those dynamics are unfolding alongside the PMR launch.

